i)    a proposed implementation strategy for the enhanced response to dogs that pose a risk to public safety;

ii)    proposed amendments to the Dog Licensing and Control By-law – PH-4 and, where required, the Administrative Monetary Penalty System By-law – A-54;

iii)    finalized assessment, investigation and operational procedures developed in coordination with the City’s contracted animal services provider, London Animal Care Centre; and,

